cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "octopus_mare_post_processing_mobile"
abstract: >-
  Processing code for the mobile part of an environmental sensing campaign in
  Maré, Rio de Janeiro. It turns raw sensor recordings into individual walk
  files, cleans their timestamps and map-matches their GPS positions onto the
  OpenStreetMap road network. It documents how the released dataset
  (https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23105404) was derived from the raw recordings.
authors:
